            <title>[LU-21180] kunit test framework for faster and more comprehensive tests</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21180</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Prototype a framework to perform fast kunit tests to act as a complement to the sanity integration tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Target is to have very fast tests that a developer can use when iterating.&lt;br/&gt;
Allowing to run more comprehensive tests including "negative tests" with invalid arguments or incorrect API use.&lt;br/&gt;
Reaching and testing functions not reachable from userspace.&lt;br/&gt;
Getting measure on coverage using KERNEL_GCOV&lt;br/&gt;
(also combine with DEBUG_KMEMLEAK)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
